NOT TESTED AGAINST A REAL PRODUCTION SYSTEM
-------------------------------------------

This software was built against synthetic schemas modelled on production
shapes. The bundled Task Recorder recording fixture is synthetic, and the
end-to-end suite runs against a mock reproducing D365's DOM contract — not
a live environment. No part of it has been validated against an actual
Dynamics 365 Finance & Operations instance.

Treat the mapping table in src/lower.rs, the selectors in runtime/d365.ts,
and every generated spec as a starting point to verify, not as working
code. Run against a sandbox or test environment first, never straight at
production.


